{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d291f721cf4d49a8","name":"LV8-Series Guard Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-d291f721cf4d49a8","title":"LV8-Series Guard Droid","revision":20243,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:28:45Z","sha256":"29ddb0f0fc8bd5c5b4407bf8512997f22b0e802f534766a3173aea5467e12e2b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20243","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=LV8-Series%20Guard%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d291f721cf4d49a8","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A low-cost Droid designed to protect its owner and his or her property, the LV8-Series Guard Droid is a simple Combat Droid with impressive defensive capabilities. Following ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Baktoid Combat Automata"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Baktoid_Combat_Automata","referenceId":"reference:d759d0449434ca4c"}," was dismantled and absorbed into ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", but many of the engineers that worked for Baktoid fled and went into seclusion, taking their research with them. Following the rise of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"},", these exiles came together to form a new Droid manufacturing consortium, which they labeled ",{"tag":"a","children":["Baktoid Industrial Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Baktoid_Industrial_Systems?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Focused less on Combat Droids and more on creating cutting-edge industrial designs, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Baktoid Industrial"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Baktoid_Industrial?action=edit&redlink=1"}," Systems reestablished the Baktoid brand as a leader in the field of Droid engineering.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Unfortunately, many other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Manufacturers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Manufacturers","referenceId":"reference:41c1bfb8b5b00c0a"}," were not pleased with the return of Baktoid, and the newly reformed company endured several months of industrial espionage, sabotage, and direct threats from agents of their competitors. To protect their assets, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Baktoid Industrial Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Baktoid_Industrial_Systems?action=edit&redlink=1"}," engineered the LV8-Series Guard Droids and began placing them in key industrial locations to prevent sabotage. The Droids were so effective and cheap to produce that Baktoid began mass manufacturing the Droids. Many docking bays use LV8-Series Guard Droids to protect their hangars from intruders.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["LV8-Series Guard Droids can't be played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["LV8-Series Guard Droid Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["4th-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/4th-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +15; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53